# Normalise line endings to LF everywhere.
#
# This is not cosmetic. CI asserts that a freshly generated case set is
# byte-identical to the committed one (`.github/workflows/ci.yml`, job
# `reproducibility`). If a Windows checkout silently rewrites line endings, that
# assertion fails for a reason that has nothing to do with the code.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
